</applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>EMORI HIDEYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJITA SHIGERU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KISHII YUTAKA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NOUMI SHUNSUKE</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>UETANI YOSHIHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMAMOTO KAZUSHIGE</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMAMURA YUTAKA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>EMORI, HIDEYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJITA, SHIGERU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KISHII, YUTAKA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NOUMI, SHUNSUKE</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UETANI, YOSHIHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMAMOTO, KAZUSHIGE</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMAMURA, YUTAKA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A porous film made from a polymer composition comprising (a) a polymer having in the main chain carbon-carbon double bonds and C5-C10 aliphatic rings and (b) another resin, a porous film as described above wherein the whole or part of the carbon-carbon double bonds are vanished, and a porous film as described above wherein the polymer (a) and the resin (b) are crosslinked, which have proper porosity, gas permeability and piercing strength and are particularly excellent in latent heat resistance or heat resistance; processes for the production of the porous films; battery separators made of the films; and batteries wherein the separators are arranged.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne des films poreux obtenus à partir d'une composition polymère contenant a) un polymère ayant des doubles liaisons dans la chaîne principale carbone-carbone et des cycles aliphatiques C5-C10 et b) une autre résine. Un des films poreux présente des doubles liaisons carbone-carbone partiellement ou totalement évanescentes et un autre film poreux présente un polymère (a) et une résine (b) réticulés présentant une porosité, une perméabilité aux gaz et une résistance au perçage correctes ce qui leur confère des propriétés efficaces pour la résistance à la chaleur latente ou à la chaleur. L'invention concerne aussi des procédés d'obtention de ces films poreux, des séparateurs de batterie fabriqués à partir de ces films et des batteries dans lesquelles sont logés les séparateurs.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>